{"project":{"startingElement":"76724a0b-9935-4c27-9941-90c63f3a795c","boards":{"b031a811-813e-45a6-8d7f-30c0e4e46eac":{"name":"01 \u00b7 World event flows","notes":["6c069694-7fea-4980-b59d-d9dc2c857cc4","e1d06b05-73ac-4040-97d1-04a6f8091204","b7583d4b-fa40-4507-9057-7d2538281cc6","63297b78-e94e-4676-9e36-7dbdb9b02061","567ce162-983d-43ba-b0d6-409dce845e18","0bb7461c-3c0e-4337-8000-ef8c544dfd29","8a1702ae-b5fe-44cb-bacd-97868065a17c"],"jumpers":[],"branches":["e110b153-2cfa-4294-adcc-e4b14cd0aef3","270da112-6a6e-466e-b090-d0c0bb7c74ee","fabbd4d2-3d23-41de-b66a-7f819fe7723e","5a5c96ae-ef6f-421e-b2da-efca55bc5bc3"],"customId":"restore_power_quest","elements":["e60800d3-a5aa-49c4-9b9c-fb5f8c1c09e7","53a8e27d-542d-4222-85fc-36073d0e37df","bfc100c0-7b99-4404-a71c-c1b42b102c02","10be7825-974e-4306-b8e4-d2bbc63486dd","05d919db-a991-45b7-b20f-db02dbd6f307","76724a0b-9935-4c27-9941-90c63f3a795c","ebdc3d2e-5680-4b07-831c-fa919ef56da2","df460871-e5db-4974-87f8-1b071d5039e6","35f2414d-8156-474e-98d3-eaf74211d45b","802dcbdf-3cf6-4f75-8cbc-f8f03053f85e","6af8cc14-6034-4e97-ab3f-6ebbdc207161","f2d75b83-f348-4b58-8190-b68d119db86d","2689f5bc-f257-4b93-8d03-16760617ef62","41df4d86-d079-4785-a22a-013597633640","c80115f9-8323-42c8-b514-6d7895ad6852","f0fd0f64-ef53-446f-a43b-63746394bba0","469d524b-9a3e-41b4-9f94-67a17246b608","988b8226-23eb-4990-b481-19cd7cd3145c","12c92fd1-be9a-40c9-9bc3-1d6f5573ee9a","961efa28-f033-44aa-ae8f-25bcb9a8e3e1"],"attributes":null,"connections":["d1857eb2-d333-4106-a851-f9f57f3c7a18","9670de6b-0cd3-4e0e-9e2c-05497b6ea6a8","35020249-1368-47c3-a8ca-358dce19746d","125db735-28b7-4f4c-9ff1-f3d61a086977","445828a6-f158-4e76-bbb1-34351ca30e48","3c3ab1e7-4dc5-473e-9c75-c436ead68314","7cfc50ee-e91b-4134-b4b3-e1c7fe49418e","5ccb6af8-2cd3-4061-9443-8fe6c31e23e9","728a4dc4-33d6-44fa-8dc1-f4e2839ddeff","7f315855-0c73-4087-bf3e-adbebfa82eae","e7253f89-1829-4d47-a08b-30ea13c87b1d","5491040d-2070-41f1-87d0-f50380a0560a","e47e38aa-d0f1-42b8-9434-9156e121730a","cf1cba2c-37e7-445e-be8d-8074e4ee251a","001db9e3-0994-414e-aa9d-f0d8df03efd1","bad0e004-b1c5-497f-89b0-f18585d4e881","d615dd01-51af-4054-a2e6-0150e6f7b06e","a2305253-4007-482c-8181-dcc093f75d48"]},"a9ad17ae-15e4-49b7-aff7-7df07bc1f5a2":{"connections":["9c12295b-eedf-4ffc-88e3-14d3b68db577","cc38c1c6-ac22-4f84-9b6a-504c9f229da3","ded4ebaf-f02c-42e7-ba16-51f3605afe1e","616ab008-c762-4ae5-b5b5-9dc42ce4c307","634f7d62-b92c-4017-8611-2f775a54ff05","8097bcd1-3a2c-4151-a7fe-149f63f71533","b782ed46-246d-4c30-aa99-73753c446c1e","e58f809d-92d9-43b1-b49a-4a522f5ecaba"],"elements":["7be79d97-39d8-4179-ad71-4b60b4ee62c8","13031eea-0fa8-4721-ac16-8a583906a6ae","09438fc8-be1d-4f8a-adad-30170999ca60","172fb20d-be4b-40f7-acec-fb22e76afe50","825244f4-6345-4314-b731-1f378ae010a1","b87fd479-2ae1-4201-aaae-a738b8b53f99","a21dc333-37fa-4de2-9213-0acfbfff4811"],"jumpers":[],"name":"02 \u00b7 Objectives and interface","branches":["3cd93c4b-0dbb-47b0-9335-f36e3a27af08","6562a23b-ba75-455b-9cba-119f77f7dd80"],"customId":"quest_presentation","notes":["617a47ca-5627-4dd4-a761-e4e9436af53c"]}},"notes":{"6c069694-7fea-4980-b59d-d9dc2c857cc4":{"x":8500,"y":6800,"theme":"purple","width":3500,"height":310,"content":"<p><strong>WORLD EVENTS \u00b7 read each lane from left to right<\/strong><\/p><p>Unreal calls an entry point when the corresponding world event occurs. Connections inside a lane run automatically; unconnected lanes wait for their own event. Initialization never accepts the task.<\/p><p>Five global quest variables have distinct owners: questStarted and questCompleted are narrative milestones; powerRestored records the generator state; powerCells is the number of unique pickups collected by Unreal; requiredPowerCells is the authored target. The UI folder groups HUD text (hud), World text (world_text), and Quest display (quest_ui). Their nineteen scoped strings plus the five global quest variables make twenty-four runtime variables. Presentation refresh resets only quest_ui fields, preserving shared text overrides and quest state.<\/p><p>The collect_cell component requests a physical pickup. Unreal records that pickup, updates powerCells, and then follows the connection to the feedback element. restore_power and open_gate are registered C++ world actions. Completing the generator does not complete the quest: the player must enter the exit.<\/p><p>The Objectives and interface board chooses a cached display after each event. HUD drawing and focus queries only read that cache.<\/p>","autoHeight":true},"e1d06b05-73ac-4040-97d1-04a6f8091204":{"y":7560,"x":8700,"autoHeight":true,"height":140,"theme":"purple","content":"<p><strong>INITIALIZE<\/strong><\/p><p>Called once after importing fresh project defaults. Ends with arrival feedback; no automatic terminal interaction.<\/p>","width":1800},"b7583d4b-fa40-4507-9057-7d2538281cc6":{"y":8200,"x":8700,"autoHeight":true,"height":140,"theme":"purple","content":"<p><strong>TERMINAL EVENT<\/strong><\/p><p>The terminal accepts the task once, then responds to accepted, powered, or completed state.<\/p>","width":1800},"63297b78-e94e-4676-9e36-7dbdb9b02061":{"y":10100,"x":8700,"autoHeight":true,"height":140,"theme":"purple","content":"<p><strong>GENERATOR EVENT<\/strong><\/p><p>Check already-powered state first, then task acceptance, then the authored cell requirement. Success opens the gate; it does not finish the quest.<\/p>","width":1800},"567ce162-983d-43ba-b0d6-409dce845e18":{"y":11900,"x":8700,"autoHeight":true,"height":140,"theme":"purple","content":"<p><strong>PICKUP EVENT<\/strong><\/p><p>Narrative permission precedes the collect_cell world action. Render feedback only after Unreal updates powerCells.<\/p>","width":1800},"0bb7461c-3c0e-4337-8000-ef8c544dfd29":{"y":13050,"x":8700,"autoHeight":true,"height":140,"theme":"purple","content":"<p><strong>PHYSICAL DUPLICATE EVENT<\/strong><\/p><p>Unreal detects an already-collected world actor and executes this feedback directly. This physical fact needs no extra story variable.<\/p>","width":1800},"8a1702ae-b5fe-44cb-bacd-97868065a17c":{"y":13780,"x":8700,"autoHeight":true,"height":140,"theme":"purple","content":"<p><strong>EXIT EVENT<\/strong><\/p><p>Called by the exit overlap. Only a powered exit can set questCompleted; repeated overlaps produce feedback without repeating completion.<\/p>","width":1800},"617a47ca-5627-4dd4-a761-e4e9436af53c":{"y":8850,"x":8500,"autoHeight":true,"height":320,"theme":"purple","content":"<p><strong>OBJECTIVE AND INTERACTION DISPLAY \u00b7 defaults, then small overrides<\/strong><\/p><p>The UI folder contains HUD text (hud), World text (world_text), and Quest display (quest_ui). Shared interface strings live in the first two components; the seven quest_ui attributes hold the authored default display.<\/p><p>Entry resets each quest_ui field individually, then this graph overrides only what changes for the current state. It never resets quest globals, hud, or world_text. Unaccepted changes two prompts; Ready changes the generator prompt. The shared Powered setup changes four fields for both powered outcomes; Completed adds its mission-heading override.<\/p><p>The five final leaves retain their objective text. C++ executes the path, then caches the current hud, world_text, and quest_ui values. HUD drawing and focus queries only read that cache. Each condition row has one outgoing connection.<\/p><p>For the released Unreal plugin, put each Arcscript reset or assignment in its own code block. Consecutive code blocks execute in order.<\/p>","width":4900}},"elements":{"10be7825-974e-4306-b8e4-d2bbc63486dd":{"x":10600,"y":11360,"theme":"orange","width":360,"height":170,"outputs":[],"autoHeight":true,"components":[],"content":"<pre><code>show(\"The generator needs \", requiredPowerCells, \" power cells. You have \", powerCells, \". Collect the missing cells, then try again.\")<\/code><\/pre>","title":"<p>02b \u00b7 More cells needed<\/p>"},"53a8e27d-542d-4222-85fc-36073d0e37df":{"x":9000,"y":11200,"theme":"gold","width":360,"height":170,"outputs":["d1857eb2-d333-4106-a851-f9f57f3c7a18"],"autoHeight":true,"components":[],"content":"<p>Checking the generator...<\/p><pre><code>show(\"Power cells collected: \", powerCells, \"\/\", requiredPowerCells)<\/code><\/pre>","title":"<p>02 \u00b7 Check the generator<\/p>"},"bfc100c0-7b99-4404-a71c-c1b42b102c02":{"x":10600,"y":11060,"theme":"green","width":360,"height":170,"outputs":[],"autoHeight":true,"components":["defba3c3-cdce-4b80-91cc-b75118f1f512","80c7c42c-bb19-4065-8afa-7cd5b54776fc"],"content":"<pre><code>powerRestored = true<\/code><\/pre><p><strong>Power restored.<\/strong> The lights come on and the exit gate opens. Reach the illuminated exit to complete your escape.<\/p>","title":"<p>03 \u00b7 Power restored<\/p>"},"e60800d3-a5aa-49c4-9b9c-fb5f8c1c09e7":{"x":10600,"y":9440,"theme":"cyan","width":360,"height":170,"outputs":[],"autoHeight":true,"components":[],"content":"<pre><code>questStarted = true<\/code><\/pre><pre><code>show(\"The outpost is dark. Collect \", requiredPowerCells, \" power cells, then use the generator to restore the lights and open the exit gate.\")<\/code><\/pre><p>You can try the generator before collecting all required cells.<\/p>","title":"<p>01 \u00b7 Restore power<\/p>"},"05d919db-a991-45b7-b20f-db02dbd6f307":{"width":360,"y":10760,"x":10600,"height":170,"theme":"purple","autoHeight":true,"content":"<p>Use the terminal to accept the task first.<\/p><p>The generator is waiting for authorization. Return here after accepting the restore-power task.<\/p>","title":"<p>02a \u00b7 Accept the task first<\/p>"},"76724a0b-9935-4c27-9941-90c63f3a795c":{"width":370,"y":7900,"x":9000,"height":150,"theme":"cyan","autoHeight":true,"content":"<p>The gate has no power. Use the terminal to begin.<\/p>","title":"<p>Initialize \u00b7 station arrival<\/p>"},"ebdc3d2e-5680-4b07-831c-fa919ef56da2":{"width":370,"y":9000,"x":9000,"height":150,"theme":"cyan","autoHeight":true,"outputs":["728a4dc4-33d6-44fa-8dc1-f4e2839ddeff"],"content":"<p>Accessing station terminal\u2026<\/p>","title":"<p>Event \u00b7 use terminal<\/p>"},"df460871-e5db-4974-87f8-1b071d5039e6":{"width":370,"y":12500,"x":9000,"height":150,"theme":"cyan","autoHeight":true,"outputs":["e47e38aa-d0f1-42b8-9434-9156e121730a"],"content":"<p>Checking power cell\u2026<\/p>","title":"<p>Event \u00b7 collect a power cell<\/p>"},"35f2414d-8156-474e-98d3-eaf74211d45b":{"width":370,"y":13300,"x":9000,"height":150,"theme":"orange","autoHeight":true,"content":"<p>This power cell has already been collected.<\/p>","title":"<p>Physical duplicate \u00b7 already collected<\/p>"},"802dcbdf-3cf6-4f75-8cbc-f8f03053f85e":{"width":370,"y":14600,"x":9000,"height":150,"theme":"cyan","autoHeight":true,"outputs":["a2305253-4007-482c-8181-dcc093f75d48"],"content":"<p>Checking exit authorization\u2026<\/p>","title":"<p>Event \u00b7 enter the exit<\/p>"},"7be79d97-39d8-4179-ad71-4b60b4ee62c8":{"width":430,"y":10400,"x":9000,"height":434,"theme":"cyan","autoHeight":true,"outputs":["634f7d62-b92c-4017-8611-2f775a54ff05"],"content":"<p>Refreshing objective display.<\/p><pre><code>reset(quest_ui.mission_heading)<\/code><\/pre><pre><code>reset(quest_ui.grid_status)<\/code><\/pre><pre><code>reset(quest_ui.terminal_prompt)<\/code><\/pre><pre><code>reset(quest_ui.cell_prompt)<\/code><\/pre><pre><code>reset(quest_ui.generator_prompt)<\/code><\/pre><pre><code>reset(quest_ui.generator_label)<\/code><\/pre><pre><code>reset(quest_ui.gate_label)<\/code><\/pre>","title":"<p>Refresh \u00b7 objective and prompts<\/p>"},"b87fd479-2ae1-4201-aaae-a738b8b53f99":{"width":430,"y":11400,"x":10600,"height":180,"theme":"gold","autoHeight":true,"attributes":[],"content":"<pre><code>quest_ui.generator_prompt = \"Install cells and restore power\"<\/code><\/pre><p>Return to the generator and restore power.<\/p>","title":"<p>Display \u00b7 ready<\/p>"},"6af8cc14-6034-4e97-ab3f-6ebbdc207161":{"width":370,"y":12620,"x":11300,"height":150,"theme":"green","autoHeight":true,"content":"<pre><code>show(\"Collected a power cell (\", powerCells, \"\/\", requiredPowerCells, \").\")<\/code><\/pre>","title":"<p>Pickup accepted \u00b7 updated inventory<\/p>"},"f2d75b83-f348-4b58-8190-b68d119db86d":{"width":370,"y":14600,"x":10600,"height":150,"theme":"green","autoHeight":true,"content":"<pre><code>questCompleted = true<\/code><\/pre><p>You reached the exit. Task complete.<\/p>","title":"<p>Exit reached \u00b7 task complete<\/p>"},"2689f5bc-f257-4b93-8d03-16760617ef62":{"width":370,"y":9140,"x":10600,"height":150,"theme":"cyan","autoHeight":true,"content":"<p>The terminal's task has already been accepted. Continue restoring power to the station.<\/p>","title":"<p>Terminal \u00b7 task already accepted<\/p>"},"41df4d86-d079-4785-a22a-013597633640":{"width":370,"y":8840,"x":10600,"height":150,"theme":"green","autoHeight":true,"content":"<p>Power is restored and the gate is open. Walk through the exit to complete the task.<\/p>","title":"<p>Terminal \u00b7 exit is ready<\/p>"},"c80115f9-8323-42c8-b514-6d7895ad6852":{"width":370,"y":8540,"x":10600,"height":150,"theme":"green","autoHeight":true,"content":"<p>The terminal confirms the task is complete.<\/p>","title":"<p>Terminal \u00b7 task already complete<\/p>"},"f0fd0f64-ef53-446f-a43b-63746394bba0":{"width":370,"y":10460,"x":10600,"height":150,"theme":"green","autoHeight":true,"content":"<p>The generator is already running and the gate is open.<\/p>","title":"<p>Generator \u00b7 already online<\/p>"},"469d524b-9a3e-41b4-9f94-67a17246b608":{"width":370,"y":12320,"x":10600,"height":150,"theme":"purple","autoHeight":true,"content":"<p>Use the terminal to accept the task first.<\/p>","title":"<p>Pickup denied \u00b7 accept the task<\/p>"},"988b8226-23eb-4990-b481-19cd7cd3145c":{"width":370,"y":12620,"x":10600,"height":150,"theme":"gold","autoHeight":true,"components":["06f4de3e-a022-472e-a2f9-bd73ee5875ee"],"outputs":["cf1cba2c-37e7-445e-be8d-8074e4ee251a"],"content":"<p>Collecting the power cell\u2026<\/p>","title":"<p>World action \u00b7 collect the focused cell<\/p>"},"12c92fd1-be9a-40c9-9bc3-1d6f5573ee9a":{"width":370,"y":14900,"x":10600,"height":150,"theme":"orange","autoHeight":true,"content":"<p>The exit has no power. Restore power at the generator first.<\/p>","title":"<p>Exit denied \u00b7 restore power<\/p>"},"961efa28-f033-44aa-ae8f-25bcb9a8e3e1":{"width":370,"y":14300,"x":10600,"height":150,"theme":"green","autoHeight":true,"content":"<p>You have already reached the exit. The task is complete.<\/p>","title":"<p>Exit \u00b7 already complete<\/p>"},"13031eea-0fa8-4721-ac16-8a583906a6ae":{"width":430,"y":9460,"x":12200,"height":180,"theme":"green","autoHeight":true,"attributes":[],"content":"<pre><code>quest_ui.mission_heading = \"MISSION COMPLETE\"<\/code><\/pre><p>Task complete. You reached the exit.<\/p>","title":"<p>Display \u00b7 completed<\/p>"},"09438fc8-be1d-4f8a-adad-30170999ca60":{"width":430,"y":9860,"x":12200,"height":180,"theme":"green","autoHeight":true,"attributes":[],"content":"<p>Power restored. Walk through the open gate.<\/p>","title":"<p>Display \u00b7 powered<\/p>"},"172fb20d-be4b-40f7-acec-fb22e76afe50":{"width":430,"y":10600,"x":10600,"height":180,"theme":"purple","autoHeight":true,"attributes":[],"content":"<pre><code>quest_ui.terminal_prompt = \"Read station terminal\"<\/code><\/pre><pre><code>quest_ui.cell_prompt = \"Read the station terminal first\"<\/code><\/pre><p>Use the terminal to begin.<\/p>","title":"<p>Display \u00b7 unaccepted<\/p>"},"825244f4-6345-4314-b731-1f378ae010a1":{"width":430,"y":11000,"x":10600,"height":180,"theme":"orange","autoHeight":true,"attributes":[],"content":"<pre><code>show(\"Collect power cells (\", powerCells, \"\/\", requiredPowerCells, \"), then use the generator.\")<\/code><\/pre>","title":"<p>Display \u00b7 collecting<\/p>"},"a21dc333-37fa-4de2-9213-0acfbfff4811":{"width":420,"y":9700,"x":10600,"height":280,"theme":"green","autoHeight":true,"outputs":["8097bcd1-3a2c-4151-a7fe-149f63f71533"],"content":"<p>U